                },
                {
                    "file": "src/nvidia-gpu/NvidiaPcieDevice.cpp",
                    "line": 232,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Harshit Aghera",
                        "email": "haghera@nvidia.com",
                        "username": "harshit-aghera"
                    },
                    "message": "Is there MCTP VDM command to retrieve number of PCIe functions? Please get the value for number of PCIe functions from inband and see if it is more than on."
                },
                {
                    "file": "src/nvidia-gpu/NvidiaPcieDevice.cpp",
                    "line": 232,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Ender",
                        "email": "andhsieh@nvidia.com",
                        "username": "Ender-Hsieh"
                    },
                    "message": "Same as the GPU commit \u2014 there is no NSM Type 2 command to retrieve the number of PCIe functions.\n\nFrom the host side with lspci, the CX8 PCIe switch ports ([15b3:197c]) are all single-function:\n$ lspci -nn | grep 'ConnectX'\n15:00.0 PCI bridge: ... ConnectX ... [15b3:197c]   \u2190 .0 only\n16:00.0 PCI bridge: ... ConnectX ... [15b3:197c]   \u2190 .0 only\n16:01.0 PCI bridge: ... ConnectX ... [15b3:197c]   \u2190 .0 only\n...\n\nSince the CX device in dbus-sensors represents the PCIe switch (DEVICE_PCIE), and there is no NSM command to query function count dynamically, we create a single Function0 for the device identity."
                },
                {
                    "file": "src/nvidia-gpu/NvidiaPcieInterface.hpp",
                    "line": 55,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Harshit Aghera",
                        "email": "haghera@nvidia.com",
                        "username": "harshit-aghera"
                    },
                    "message": "Let's do this in a separate commit, please."
                },
                {
                    "file": "src/nvidia-gpu/NvidiaPcieInterface.hpp",
                    "line": 55,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Ender",
                        "email": "andhsieh@nvidia.com",
                        "username": "Ender-Hsieh"
                    },
                    "message": "Done"
                }
